1
00:00:20,800 --> 00:00:22,700
(Silence; Operating Room Area)

2
00:00:39,680 --> 00:00:43,560
=Stand Up for Love=

3
00:00:43,720 --> 00:00:46,680
=Episode 8=

4
00:00:57,000 --> 00:00:58,799
So you still wanted to talk, didn't you?

5
00:00:59,759 --> 00:01:01,600
The only difference is the location.

6
00:01:01,600 --> 00:01:03,119
Last time, it was in the car.

7
00:01:03,320 --> 00:01:04,799
This time, it's in a fitting room.

8
00:01:06,040 --> 00:01:09,239
Mr. Zhang, you really do enjoy a thrill.

9
00:01:09,840 --> 00:01:11,239
Miss Zhao, do you know

10
00:01:11,920 --> 00:01:13,359
when we were at the nightclub,

11
00:01:13,959 --> 00:01:16,040
how I managed to pick you out

12
00:01:16,040 --> 00:01:17,319
from all those people

13
00:01:18,359 --> 00:01:19,599
wearing masks at a glance?

14
00:01:20,319 --> 00:01:21,519
How did you recognize me?

15
00:01:24,040 --> 00:01:24,719
Your sense of style.

16
00:01:26,200 --> 00:01:28,719
That day, you were wearing
a long white dress.

17
00:01:29,120 --> 00:01:31,280
Among all those wild, dancing people,

18
00:01:31,799 --> 00:01:33,040
you stood out with your elegance.

19
00:01:33,799 --> 00:01:35,000
You were impossible to miss.

20
00:01:36,359 --> 00:01:37,840
You're quite the charmer.

21
00:01:37,840 --> 00:01:40,000
Fine. I'll help you try it on.

22
00:01:43,359 --> 00:01:45,040
Take your clothes off yourself.

23
00:01:46,079 --> 00:01:47,280
Or do you need me to do it for you?

24
00:02:18,400 --> 00:02:19,159
Haotian.

25
00:02:20,840 --> 00:02:22,759
I bought you some pajamas.

26
00:02:23,120 --> 00:02:24,439
Do you want to try them on?

27
00:02:24,599 --> 00:02:27,319
Are you really willing to let me
live with you?

28
00:02:28,720 --> 00:02:29,180
Yeah.

29
00:02:29,560 --> 00:02:30,360
I am.

30
00:02:45,439 --> 00:02:47,439
Mr. Zhang, you're in great shape.

31
00:02:47,479 --> 00:02:48,919
No wonder Ms. Lin

32
00:02:49,120 --> 00:02:50,240
cherishes you so much.

33
00:02:51,280 --> 00:02:52,840
Didn't you already know
I was in good shape?

34
00:02:54,080 --> 00:02:55,439
Put the clothes on.

35
00:02:55,840 --> 00:02:58,439
I'll be a better judge once
I see you in them.

36
00:03:12,439 --> 00:03:13,520
Zhao Ke.

37
00:03:18,960 --> 00:03:20,000
What's wrong, baby?

38
00:03:24,439 --> 00:03:26,199
When did you start seeing her?

39
00:03:26,840 --> 00:03:28,919
Was it that night she stayed
in the guest room?

40
00:03:30,759 --> 00:03:31,520
(Seems like)

41
00:03:31,840 --> 00:03:33,280
(she found out about Zhao Ke and me.)

42
00:03:33,400 --> 00:03:34,439
(That was fast.)

43
00:03:35,280 --> 00:03:36,080
Yes.

44
00:03:38,439 --> 00:03:41,000
Zhang Haotian, you won't even bother

45
00:03:41,000 --> 00:03:42,639
lying to comfort me anymore?

46
00:03:42,639 --> 00:03:43,319
Do you really

47
00:03:43,840 --> 00:03:45,879
want a divorce right
after we got married?

48
00:03:46,879 --> 00:03:47,639
Baby.

49
00:03:47,960 --> 00:03:48,879
What does Zhao Ke have

50
00:03:48,879 --> 00:03:50,680
that I don't?

51
00:03:50,800 --> 00:03:52,360
Can you just listen to me?

52
00:03:53,439 --> 00:03:54,080
Go on.

53
00:03:56,280 --> 00:03:57,759
After that time in the guest room, I...

54
00:03:59,240 --> 00:04:00,719
I spent a long time thinking
about Zhao Ke

55
00:04:00,919 --> 00:04:02,240
before meeting her today.

56
00:04:02,240 --> 00:04:03,599
But the moment I got to know her,
I realized

57
00:04:03,599 --> 00:04:04,639
she was just a vulgar woman,

58
00:04:04,879 --> 00:04:06,080
greedy and shallow,

59
00:04:06,080 --> 00:04:07,080
someone who would take anyone
who came along.

60
00:04:07,360 --> 00:04:09,479
I regret wasting so much time on her.

61
00:04:11,479 --> 00:04:12,840
Then what about

62
00:04:12,840 --> 00:04:13,639
the two minutes and thirty-nine seconds

63
00:04:13,639 --> 00:04:14,879
you spent with her in that fitting room?

64
00:04:14,879 --> 00:04:15,879
She wanted to replace you.

65
00:04:16,199 --> 00:04:17,079
I turned her down.

66
00:04:17,399 --> 00:04:20,240
The more she tried to take your place,
the more I thought of you.

67
00:04:21,160 --> 00:04:21,759
Lulu,

68
00:04:22,759 --> 00:04:24,040
you are the only woman

69
00:04:24,040 --> 00:04:25,879
I want to cherish for the rest
of my life.

70
00:04:26,879 --> 00:04:29,439
I just needed to be sure of that.

71
00:04:31,439 --> 00:04:32,480
Besides Zhao Ke,

72
00:04:32,959 --> 00:04:34,600
is there anyone else?

73
00:04:35,639 --> 00:04:36,879
Of course not.

74
00:04:37,279 --> 00:04:39,199
Zhao Ke was already enough
to make me regret everything.

75
00:04:39,639 --> 00:04:40,800
I don't believe you.

76
00:04:41,879 --> 00:04:42,480
Lulu.

77
00:04:44,160 --> 00:04:45,879
Does seeing me just make you angry now?

78
00:04:46,160 --> 00:04:46,680
Yes!

79
00:04:47,319 --> 00:04:49,399
Every time I look at you,
I think of Zhao Ke.

80
00:04:49,399 --> 00:04:51,879
Thinking about her touching
you drives me insane.

81
00:04:52,839 --> 00:04:53,879
Then...

82
00:04:56,279 --> 00:04:57,879
maybe we should take some time apart.

83
00:05:00,480 --> 00:05:01,040
Don't go.

84
00:05:01,040 --> 00:05:02,680
I don't want you to suffer!

85
00:05:09,800 --> 00:05:11,439
Fine. I believe you, okay?

86
00:05:13,839 --> 00:05:14,839
(That's more like it.)

87
00:05:18,160 --> 00:05:19,879
My mother-in-law will find out
sooner or later.

88
00:05:21,519 --> 00:05:23,079
She never wanted me to marry you
in the first place.

89
00:05:33,240 --> 00:05:34,279
And this time,

90
00:05:35,879 --> 00:05:37,680
she'll never let me be with you.

91
00:05:38,519 --> 00:05:39,680
But it doesn't matter.

92
00:05:39,920 --> 00:05:41,720
We signed a prenuptial agreement.

93
00:05:42,199 --> 00:05:42,879
Divorce

94
00:05:43,879 --> 00:05:46,040
would just mean signing another
piece of paper.

95
00:05:47,920 --> 00:05:49,079
I won't make things difficult for you.

96
00:05:50,600 --> 00:05:53,079
Zhang Haotian, if you say that again,

97
00:05:53,079 --> 00:05:54,720
I'll never forgive you!

98
00:06:04,839 --> 00:06:06,639
(A hopeless romantic is so easy
to fool.)

99
00:06:07,000 --> 00:06:09,160
(A few sweet words and she's
completely wrapped around my finger.)

100
00:06:10,240 --> 00:06:11,000
(Everything is going)

101
00:06:11,560 --> 00:06:13,240
(according to my plan.)

102
00:06:13,839 --> 00:06:15,519
(I need to get my hands
on the prenuptial agreement.)

103
00:06:16,240 --> 00:06:17,720
(But before that,)

104
00:06:18,199 --> 00:06:20,399
(I'll deal with that wretched woman
Zhao Ke first.)

105
00:06:33,720 --> 00:06:34,519
Hey.

106
00:06:35,800 --> 00:06:36,920
Why did you take so long to answer?

107
00:06:38,120 --> 00:06:38,720
What's going on?

108
00:06:38,720 --> 00:06:39,800
Did you handle everything?

109
00:06:40,920 --> 00:06:43,120
Of course. I'm Zhang Haotian.

110
00:06:44,720 --> 00:06:45,519
Cool.

111
00:06:47,240 --> 00:06:48,199
How did you make it work?

112
00:06:48,600 --> 00:06:50,199
Lulu has two weaknesses.

113
00:06:50,199 --> 00:06:52,040
First, she's afraid of losing me.

114
00:06:52,519 --> 00:06:53,240
Second,

115
00:06:53,959 --> 00:06:56,319
because Su Qinglan forced me
to sign that prenup,

116
00:06:56,480 --> 00:06:57,720
she feels guilty toward me.

117
00:06:58,399 --> 00:07:00,519
As long as she doesn't catch me
in the act,

118
00:07:00,800 --> 00:07:01,839
a little doubt here and there

119
00:07:01,879 --> 00:07:03,879
will only make her cherish me more.

120
00:07:05,199 --> 00:07:06,839
Once the prenuptial agreement
is revoked,

121
00:07:07,519 --> 00:07:09,560
we can move forward with
the next step of our plan.

122
00:07:20,040 --> 00:07:21,440
(All-Star Party Space)

123
00:07:24,439 --> 00:07:26,680
Zhao Ke, you've got some nerve.

124
00:07:27,079 --> 00:07:28,480
You actually dared to seduce my husband.

125
00:07:28,680 --> 00:07:30,439
Do you even know your place?

126
00:07:30,439 --> 00:07:31,920
Do you know who the Lin family is?

127
00:07:32,319 --> 00:07:33,319
If you're looking for trouble,

128
00:07:33,680 --> 00:07:35,279
I can make that happen in a heartbeat.

129
00:07:36,040 --> 00:07:37,800
You'd better keep your husband in check

130
00:07:37,800 --> 00:07:38,800
and tell him to stop bothering me.

131
00:07:40,519 --> 00:07:42,319
You're saying my husband seduced you?

132
00:07:42,399 --> 00:07:43,040
Zhao Ke.

133
00:07:43,439 --> 00:07:45,480
Don't flatter yourself.

134
00:07:46,160 --> 00:07:47,079
I'm warning you.

135
00:07:47,399 --> 00:07:49,439
If you dare go after my husband again,

136
00:07:49,720 --> 00:07:51,240
you'll regret it.

137
00:07:57,840 --> 00:07:59,880
(A Battle of Hearts)

138
00:08:00,800 --> 00:08:04,680
♪Listen, the wind chimes softly whisper♪

139
00:08:04,760 --> 00:08:07,560
♪I should forget you♪

140
00:08:08,400 --> 00:08:12,800
♪But I have the will,
yet not the strength♪

141
00:08:13,240 --> 00:08:14,760
♪To carry on♪

142
00:08:15,640 --> 00:08:20,000
♪The scenery you once longed to see♪

143
00:08:20,760 --> 00:08:23,680
♪You no longer have the strength♪

144
00:08:25,120 --> 00:08:28,480
♪You want me to go there for you♪

145
00:08:29,320 --> 00:08:34,640
♪I look up and see a hollow sky♪

146
00:08:34,960 --> 00:08:38,800
♪Your freedom♪

147
00:08:39,480 --> 00:08:44,280
♪Has become my cage♪

148
00:08:45,000 --> 00:08:51,080
♪My hand brushes over your smile
in the photograph♪

149
00:08:51,400 --> 00:08:57,200
♪This glass of wine is filled
with sorrow♪

150
00:08:58,520 --> 00:09:04,600
♪I look up at the beautiful night sky♪

151
00:09:04,640 --> 00:09:07,480
♪You told me♪

152
00:09:07,480 --> 00:09:12,640
♪I would shine like a star♪

153
00:09:13,720 --> 00:09:17,680
♪But you forgot to teach me♪

154
00:09:17,680 --> 00:09:21,320
♪How to live without you♪

155
00:09:21,560 --> 00:09:25,720
♪I look up♪

156
00:09:25,720 --> 00:09:28,480
♪The starry sky♪

157
00:09:28,800 --> 00:09:32,280
♪So hazy and blurred♪
